---
import { useTranslations } from "@/i18n";
import RootLayout from "@/layouts/RootLayout.astro";
import ServicesHero from "@/components/ServicesHero.astro";
import featuredImage from "@/assets/seo-orange.png";
import OrangeAlert from "@/components/OrangeAlert.astro";
const t = useTranslations();

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  name: "Houston Digital Marketing Agency",
  provider: {
    "@type": "LocalBusiness",
    name: "AJ Dichmann",
    areaServed: "Texas",
  },
  serviceType: "Houston Digital Marketing Agency",
};
---

<RootLayout
  title="Houston Digital Marketing Agency | AJ Dichmann"
  description="Get started with the top rated Wordpress experts in Houston for SEO and Web Development"
>
  <schema item={schema}></schema>
  <ServicesHero
    title="Houston Digital Marketing Agency"
    description="Get started with the top rated WordPress team in Houston. Our team has countless years of building, fixing and maintaining WordPress websites under our belt."
    blogLink={{
      text: "What's new in SEO",
      url: "/tags/seo/",
    }}
    image={{
      src: featuredImage,
      alt: "Houston Digital Marketing",
      width: 400,
      height: 534,
    }}
    breadcrumbsText="Houston Digital Marketing"
  />

  <!-- Rest of the content -->
  <div class="divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-700 relative z-10">
    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none relative z-10">
      <h2>Local Houston Digital Marketing Experts</h2>
      <p>
        Looking for a trusted digital marketing agency in Houston that delivers real results? You've found it. Our team of seasoned marketers, designers, and strategists is dedicated to helping local businesses grow with targeted, data-driven solutions. Whether you're just starting out or ready to scale, we've got your back.
      </p>
      <p>
        We know the Houston market because we live and work here in Harris and Montgomery counties. That means we understand your customers and your competition. We don't offer one-size-fits-all packages—we listen to your goals and build a custom strategy to get you where you want to go. Our services cover everything from SEO and paid ads to social media, web design, and more.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you're ready to partner with a local team that truly cares about your success, let's talk. We believe in open communication, measurable results, and building long-term relationships that help businesses thrive online.
      </p>
  
      <h2>SEO Services in Houston</h2>
      <p>
        Search Engine Optimization (SEO) is the foundation of any strong online presence. Our Houston SEO services are built around getting your website found by the right people—at the right time. We use proven strategies to help your site rank higher on Google and drive more organic traffic that actually converts.
      </p>
      <p>
        From technical audits to keyword research, on-page optimization, and backlink building, we handle all aspects of SEO with care. We stay on top of the latest algorithm updates, so you don't have to. Our goal is simple: get your website in front of more local customers and grow your business steadily and sustainably.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether you're a small business trying to compete in a crowded space or an established company looking to expand your reach, our local SEO experts will develop a strategy tailored to your goals. Because when you win, we win.
      </p>
  
      <ul>
        <li>Keyword research & on-page optimization</li>
        <li>Technical SEO & site performance improvements</li>
        <li>Local SEO strategies to dominate Houston search results</li>
      </ul>
  
      <h2>Google Ads Management</h2>
      <p>
        Need results fast? Our Google Ads specialists can help you reach your ideal customers instantly with high-converting PPC campaigns. Whether you're running search ads, display banners, or remarketing, we build each campaign from the ground up with your goals and budget in mind.
      </p>
      <p>
        We don't just set it and forget it. We monitor your ad performance daily, optimize for conversions, and A/B test copy and creatives to make sure you're getting the most value for every dollar spent. You'll have full visibility into your campaigns, with clear reporting and strategy updates.
      </p>
      <p>
        Many South Texas businesses come to us frustrated by past experiences with paid ads. We get it. Our difference is in the strategy and transparency. You'll always know what we're doing and why—and you'll see the impact in your bottom line.
      </p>
  
      <h2>Facebook Ads & Social Media Marketing</h2>
      <p>
        Social media is more than just posts and likes—it's about connecting with your audience and turning attention into action. Our Houston-based social media marketing team creates smart, engaging campaigns that elevate your brand and drive meaningful engagement on platforms like Facebook, Instagram, and LinkedIn.
      </p>
      <p>
        From targeted Facebook Ads to organic content strategy, we build your social presence around what matters to your customers. Whether you want to grow your followers, drive traffic, or generate leads, we help you show up and stand out in the social feed.
      </p>
      <p>
        We also provide in-depth analytics and insights so you always know what's working. Our creative team handles everything—graphics, video, captions, and calls to action—so you can focus on running your business while we grow your digital footprint.
      </p>
  
      <h2>Web Design & Development</h2>
      <p>
        Your website is your digital storefront—and it needs to impress. Our Houston web design and development team builds stunning, responsive websites that not only look great, but are also designed to convert. </p>
        
        Whether you're starting from scratch or refreshing an existing site, we deliver custom solutions built to grow your business on platforms like WordPress, Shopify and custom code!
      </p>
      <p>
        We design every site with the user in mind, ensuring it's easy to navigate, loads quickly, and works beautifully on every device. Our developers use clean, scalable code that performs well and is easy to maintain. We build with the latest tech, including HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, and WordPress or headless CMS setups.
      </p>
      <p>
        Beyond just looks, we optimize every site for SEO, speed, and accessibility—because a beautiful site is only effective if people can find it and use it. We're not just a design agency—we're a digital growth partner.
      </p>
  
      <h2>Compare Our Digital Marketing Services</h2>
      <table border="1" cellpadding="10">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Service</th>
            <th>Focus</th>
            <th>Benefits</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>SEO Services</td>
            <td>Organic Growth</td>
            <td>Higher rankings, more traffic, stronger local visibility</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Google Ads</td>
            <td>Paid Advertising</td>
            <td>Immediate visibility, lead generation,measurable ROI, audience targeting</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Facebook Ads & Social Media</td>
            <td>Brand Engagement</td>
            <td>Builds awareness, boosts traffic, drives conversions</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Web Design & Development</td>
            <td>Online Presence</td>
            <td>Professional look, mobile-friendly, optimized for SEO</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
  
      <h2>Why Choose Our Houston Digital Marketing Company?</h2>
      <p>
        We're not your typical digital agency. We're your neighbors—rooted in Houston and invested in your success. We've worked with dozens of local businesses across industries, helping them grow their online presence and reach their goals with personalized marketing strategies.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our team believes in results, not fluff. Everything we do is backed by data, guided by experience, and built to move the needle. Whether you need a full marketing team or just help in one area, we'll meet you where you are and take you further.
      </p>
      <p>
        Transparency and communication are at the heart of how we work. We explain our process in plain language, provide frequent updates, and measure success together with you. When you work with us, you're not just hiring a vendor—you're gaining a long-term partner.
      </p>
  
      <ul>
        <li>Experienced team with a proven track record</li>
        <li>Fully custom strategies—no cookie-cutter packages</li>
        <li>Friendly, local support from experts who care</li>
      </ul>
  
      <h2>Let's Talk About Your Marketing Project</h2>
      <p>
        Whether you're starting a new business, launching a new product, or just looking to get better results from your marketing I am here to to help. Our Houston-based digital marketing experts are ready to create a smart, tailored strategy that fits your goals and budget.
      </p>
      <p>
        It starts with a conversation. We'll learn about your business, review your current online marketing situation, and offer clear roadmap to help you grow online. No pressure. Just honest advice and proven strategies.
      </p>
      <p>
        Call us at (972) 538-0260 to speak with a real human about your project. Let's get started!
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  
 </RootLayout>
